    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39888" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί-κρῐσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>determination</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἐκλειπτικῶν τηρήσεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					1.1.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνημμένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.43c
				</span></i>
			 (pl.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				9.92
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				151.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				5.3.2
			</span></i>; <i>discrimination</i> of scents, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
				<i>verification</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(2).354
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.117
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. in Egypt,
			revision of lists and <i>selection</i> of privileged persons,
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				288.35
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFay.</u>
				27.24
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				324.2
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>. <i>judgement</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.38
			</span></i>, al.; arbitrator's <i>award</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				364.6
			</span></i> (Ephesus, pl.).</div>
